<!-- Adaptive-icon background for the Spring alias: sky, sun, hill, ground and road, in that
     theme's own colours. Nothing here is invented for the icon: SceneTheme.SPRING.skyDay for the
     sky ramp, hillColorsDay[2] for the hill, hillColorsDay[0] for the meadow.

     Containment: the only drawing that has to stay inside the safe zone is the sun, at 29.79 dp
     from the centre against a safe radius of 33 dp, so 3.21 dp of margin. Everything else in this
     file reaches the edge or lies outside the mask on purpose: sky, hill, ground, asphalt, centre
     line, roadside flowers are background that bleeds under any launcher mask, and clipping them
     is the intended behaviour. -->
